{"mode":"words","text":"Nu lyssnar du på texten och läser samtidigt. Som nybörjare läser du betydelseraden på ditt modersmål, lyssnar på målspråket i långsam takt och trycker ofta på paus — på så sätt kopplar din hjärna ihop ljudet med betydelsen. Som avancerad läsare läser du originaltexten och tittar bara kort nedåt vid okända ord. Använd ofta A-B-upprepningen: markera en enskild mening och låt den spelas i en loop – prova det här ovanför.","words":[{"s":0,"e":174},{"s":221,"e":522},{"s":546,"e":604},{"s":650,"e":708},{"s":789,"e":1289},{"s":1347,"e":1440},{"s":1509,"e":1846},{"s":1927,"e":2995},{"s":3332,"e":3518},{"s":3587,"e":4272},{"s":4319,"e":4644},{"s":4667,"e":4725},{"s":4772,"e":5642},{"s":5677,"e":5735},{"s":5782,"e":5898},{"s":5944,"e":6769},{"s":7059,"e":7384},{"s":7430,"e":7512},{"s":7570,"e":8185},{"s":8243,"e":8266},{"s":8301,"e":8707},{"s":8789,"e":9195},{"s":9532,"e":9671},{"s":9706,"e":10112},{"s":10147,"e":10379},{"s":10426,"e":10507},{"s":10588,"e":11088},{"s":11250,"e":11331},{"s":11738,"e":11854},{"s":11947,"e":12179},{"s":12260,"e":12585},{"s":12713,"e":13177},{"s":13201,"e":13340},{"s":13363,"e":13746},{"s":13793,"e":14106},{"s":14153,"e":14559},{"s":14617,"e":14710},{"s":14733,"e":15569},{"s":16428,"e":16591},{"s":16649,"e":17206},{"s":17253,"e":17752},{"s":17810,"e":18170},{"s":18193,"e":18263},{"s":18297,"e":19273},{"s":19679,"e":19865},{"s":19900,"e":20283},{"s":20318,"e":20492},{"s":20561,"e":20817},{"s":20910,"e":21386},{"s":21467,"e":21629},{"s":21699,"e":22303},{"s":22396,"e":22837},{"s":23243,"e":23650},{"s":23708,"e":23940},{"s":24033,"e":25519},{"s":25705,"e":26227},{"s":26250,"e":26297},{"s":26424,"e":26877},{"s":26924,"e":27307},{"s":27376,"e":27504},{"s":27562,"e":27783},{"s":27806,"e":27911},{"s":27945,"e":28387},{"s":28445,"e":28468},{"s":28514,"e":28584},{"s":28642,"e":28897},{"s":29060,"e":29083},{"s":29269,"e":29675},{"s":29710,"e":29780},{"s":29803,"e":29954},{"s":30047,"e":30929}]}